+
+  // A direct navigation within the primary origin already has the browser's
+  // native cookie policy. Simulating it would overwrite document.cookie changes
+  // with stale jar values, on both the request and the page-load response.
+  // Chrome's Fetch interception omits Fetch Metadata headers. Its correlated
